WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.812
Open your WhatsApp account, select Flows, then Create Flow

00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:09.670
Select Templates, then Appointment booking

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.582
Page 1's button loads the free times from the calendar

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:19.066
On page 2, the times come from the data source

00:00:19.066 --> 00:00:24.418
Click Save draft, then Cancel to see its details

00:00:24.418 --> 00:00:26.605
Under Data source, click Set up data source

00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:30.311
Keep Calendar and pick your connected calendar

00:00:30.311 --> 00:00:35.103
The pages and the date question are already filled in. Check the timezone

00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:38.400
Click Save

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.804
The Flow now reads free slots from the calendar

00:00:39.804 --> 00:00:46.468
Click Publish, then Publish again to confirm

00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:50.180
Live data shows Calendar, via Ringg
